# Cloudflare Workers static-asset headers.
#
# OBS's embedded browser caches aggressively and refreshing a browser
# source does not bypass its cache, so an overlay CSS or JS change can
# sit invisible behind a stale copy indefinitely. Forcing revalidation
# means a source refresh always picks up the current file.
#
# Images, sounds and fonts are deliberately left cacheable — they are
# large and rarely change.

/overlay/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
